## Style

- Dark theme with CSS custom properties defined in `src/index.css` under `@theme`
- Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin
- Fonts: DM Sans (body) + JetBrains Mono (monospace), loaded from Google Fonts in `index.html`
- Accent colors: green (#4ade80), purple (#c084fc), amber (#fbbf24), rose (#fb7185), cyan (#22d3ee)

